5262b5c83ddf8411e6aa1c69b3d.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/59a531675a1665f03af035a732742673.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing around with a grapple hook, boost through the air with a jetpack, but at <strong>what cost to your energy</strong>? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision burns precious energy, and every action pulls you further from the person you once were. <strong>How far will you go to make it home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/487878968fb3de35494bd1010930011a.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/0735a14cb690f8162f24cfd28e1ac6e7.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IF WE MAKE IT HOME. is a video game adaptation of 'The Suit', a comic created by <strong>Scott Base</strong> as part of his <strong>'Bad Space'</strong> collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download IF WE MAKE IT HOME. for free on Steam, and dive deeper into Scott Base's mind by exploring the rest of the 'Bad Space' comics online.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Thomas Hunt","InkForge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/9495f31d8327b8d4da2c34684d00d78cfef58c17/header.jpg?t=1749213707","is_free":true,"linux